PaddleOCR model is downloaded on first engine init via Sdcb.PaddleOCR.Models.Online
(OnlineFullModels.EnglishV3.DownloadAsync()) and cached to %APPDATA%/paddleocr-models/.
No bundled model files needed — first launch pays the ~100MB download, subsequent runs
hit the disk cache. Switching to Sdcb (T90) dropped the raoyutian-era requirement of
bundling the model via MSBuild targets.